# A Journey Begins (abyssea 160): a level 99 Warrior in Port Jeuno with the quest accepted (a GM; at a login the game
# adds it anyway, #login_add). The login's zone-in at Prog 0: 324, finished: Prog 1. Out and back in at Prog 1: no
# zone-in reply. Joachim at Prog 1: 325, finished: completed (Traverser Stone 1, the traverser epoch set), The Truth
# Beckons accepted. Joachim again: The Truth Beckons' 326 (accepted, Prog 0).
lists PortJeuno/Joachim/onTrigger PortJeuno/onZoneIn/1 PortJeuno/onEventFinish/324 PortJeuno/onEventFinish/325 PortJeuno/onEventFinish/326
char zone=PortJeuno pos=-51.344,0,-9.978 job=WAR lvl=99
